h the `switch`, `argc == 0` via `execve` with empty `argv`, `/dev/full` write errors, closed fd 1.\n- `./symdiff.sh`: 0 missing / 0 unexpected undefined symbols across all 24 configs.\n- `./check_all.sh`: 26/26 feature combos `cargo check --all-targets`, 0 warnings.\n- `./run_tests.sh`: 26/26 combos, 32 tests each — **passed=26 failed=0** (rebuilds the `.so` per combo so no stale artifact can be tested).\n- Mutation checks (`dispatch_rep` `0..=7`, `run_loop` off-by-one) were injected and correctly detected, then reverted.\n\n`c_src/` was not modified; C libraries/executables are built from it into `cbuild/`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":259,"cache_read_input_tokens":160346,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":259,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ec1dea8e-8fc0-4968-b381-45ebd01444af","uuid":"6227cf30-ef78-44ec-baff-f94456ded5aa","timestamp":"2026-09-04T15:35:28.663Z"}
